{
  "info": {
    "name": "ToggleMaster - Integração Local",
    "_postman_id": "togglemaster-local-0001",
    "description": "Testes de integração entre os 5 microsserviços do ToggleMaster (docker-compose local).\n\nFLUXO RECOMENDADO (rode na ordem):\n0. Health Checks — confirma que todos respondem.\n1. Auth > Create API Key — cria a chave e CAPTURA AUTOMATICAMENTE na variável {{apiKey}} (um script de teste faz isso). Os requests seguintes já usam {{apiKey}}.\n2. Flag > Create Flag — cria a flag 'new-dashboard' (habilitada).\n3. Targeting > Create Rule — cria uma regra PERCENTAGE de 50% para a flag.\n4. Evaluation > Evaluate — pede a decisão final.\n\n⚠️ NOTA DE INTEGRAÇÃO: o evaluation-service usa a variável SERVICE_API_KEY do .env (NÃO a do Postman) para chamar flag/targeting. Enquanto o .env tiver o placeholder, o /evaluate vai falhar (502) ou retornar 'false'. Resolver isso é justamente o objetivo do debug de integração.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "authUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8001" },
    { "key": "flagUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8002" },
    { "key": "targetingUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8003" },
    { "key": "evalUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8004" },
    { "key": "analyticsUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8005" },
    { "key": "masterKey", "value": "081fc15ebfdbb6ce850e714ab2fd4f0d34167ab0669b1fa5b2b790977a67ec5b" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "flagName", "value": "new-dashboard" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "user-123" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health Checks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "auth /health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{authUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{authUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "flag /health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{flagUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{flagUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "targeting /health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{targetingUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{targetingUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "evaluation /health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{evalUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{evalUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "analytics /health",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{analyticsUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{analyticsUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create API Key (captura {{apiKey}})",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.key) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('apiKey', json.key);",
                  "  console.log('apiKey capturada e salva na variável da coleção:', json.key);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Nenhuma chave retornada — verifique a MASTER_KEY.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{masterKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"chave-de-servico\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{authUrl}}/admin/keys", "host": ["{{authUrl}}"], "path": ["admin", "keys"] },
            "description": "Cria uma API key. Exige a MASTER_KEY no header. Retorna a chave em texto plano UMA vez — o script de teste a salva em {{apiKey}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Validate API Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{authUrl}}/validate", "host": ["{{authUrl}}"], "path": ["validate"] },
            "description": "Valida a {{apiKey}}. 200 = válida, 401 = inválida/inativa. É exatamente o que flag/targeting chamam internamente."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Flag",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Flag",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{flagName}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Novo dashboard (beta)\",\n  \"is_enabled\": true\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{flagUrl}}/flags", "host": ["{{flagUrl}}"], "path": ["flags"] },
            "description": "Cria a flag. Protegido — o flag chama o auth /validate com a {{apiKey}}. 201 = criada, 401 = chave inválida, 409 = já existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Flags",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{flagUrl}}/flags", "host": ["{{flagUrl}}"], "path": ["flags"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Flag by name",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{flagUrl}}/flags/{{flagName}}", "host": ["{{flagUrl}}"], "path": ["flags", "{{flagName}}"] },
            "description": "Mesma rota que o evaluation chama internamente (GET /flags/<name>)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Targeting",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Rule (PERCENTAGE 50%)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"flag_name\": \"{{flagName}}\",\n  \"is_enabled\": true,\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"type\": \"PERCENTAGE\",\n    \"value\": 50\n  }\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{targetingUrl}}/rules", "host": ["{{targetingUrl}}"], "path": ["rules"] },
            "description": "Cria a regra de segmentação. O objeto 'rules' deve ter 'type' e 'value' (é o formato que o evaluator espera). PERCENTAGE 50 = ~metade dos usuários recebem true."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Rule by flag_name",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{targetingUrl}}/rules/{{flagName}}", "host": ["{{targetingUrl}}"], "path": ["rules", "{{flagName}}"] },
            "description": "Mesma rota que o evaluation chama internamente (GET /rules/<flag_name>)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Evaluation (hot path)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Evaluate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{evalUrl}}/evaluate?user_id={{userId}}&flag_name={{flagName}}",
              "host": ["{{evalUrl}}"],
              "path": ["evaluate"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "user_id", "value": "{{userId}}" },
                { "key": "flag_name", "value": "{{flagName}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "A decisão final (true/false). O evaluation junta flag + targeting (via SERVICE_API_KEY do .env) + cache Redis.\n\n⚠️ Se o SERVICE_API_KEY do .env ainda for o placeholder, espere 502 (Bad Gateway) ou 'false' — porque o evaluation toma 401 do flag/targeting. Trocar a SERVICE_API_KEY por uma chave real (a que a request 'Create API Key' gerou) resolve."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
